    "logic": {
      "concept": "Intraday trend following. Short-term momentum overtaking the intermediate-term trend marks the start of a directional move that other participants join over the following bars \u2014 so buy the crossover, ride the continuation, and give it back only as far as a volatility-scaled trailing stop allows.",
      "entry": "Go Long when the Fast EMA (20) crosses above the Slow EMA (89). Entry signals are only taken between 09:30 and 15:30 New York time; the fill is the next bar's open.",
      "exit": "Exit at whichever comes first. (1) The Fast EMA (20) crosses back below the Slow EMA (89). (2) A stop 2.0 x ATR 14 away \u2014 with trailing=False, True means it trails the highest price reached since the fill and never widens, False means it sits fixed that far below the fill price. (3) A take-profit 5.0 x ATR 14 above the fill price, where None means NO take-profit is modelled at all. (4) The last bar before 16:00 New York time. Every exit fills at the NEXT bar's open, so neither the stop nor the target is a fill at its own price \u2014 both carry a one-bar lag, and on a bar that breaches both the modelled fill is neither level."
    }
  },
